# Links

A URL as a note name: <https://example.com/docs#install>.

With an alias: [the docs](https://example.com/docs).

As an embed: ![Logo](https://example.com/logo.png) and ![](https://example.com/logo.png).

Without a scheme: [www.example.com](https://www.example.com).

With spaces, which a link destination cannot hold bare: [spaced](<https://example.com/a b>).
